{"sourceUrl":"https://coe.ouc.edu.cn/2025/0912/c8976a506073/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:22.281662+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://coe.ouc.edu.cn/2025/0912/c8976a506073/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><a href=\"https://coe.ouc.edu.cn/2025/0912/c8976a506073/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>各位考生：</span></p><p><span><span><span>欢迎报考</span><span><span>工程</span></span><span>学院推荐免试研究生。为方便考生提前做好推荐免试申请准备工作，现就</span></span></span><span>2026</span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博生）预报名相关事宜提醒如下：</span></p><p><span>一、预报名截止时间</span></p><p><span>中国海洋大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生预报名系统将于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日（本周日）</span><span>24</span><span>点关闭，逾期不予受理。请有意申请者尽快提交申请，切勿错过报名。</span></p><p><span>二、接收推免面试时间</span></p><p><span><span><span>学院计划</span><span><span>于</span></span></span></span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span><span>日</span><span><span>前</span></span><span>开展接收推荐免试研究生的综合考核。综合考核的具体日期、工作实施细则以及详细安排将于近日在学院网站发布，请各位考生密切关注。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>工程学院       </span></span></p><p><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"b2a457d809eb3613970052988b5e851cdedeba1dee68b989833b97b28c79aa6e","textLength":269,"sourceSha256":"1e75d8d8a895f8a13afb4fb10bf5959191cbb4f653b268638b2470531dc96a0e","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-77e0c7e19597da2b8155","title":"2025年中国海洋大学工程学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生预报名及综合考核提醒","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:22.281662+00:00"}
